	"Description": "Runtime host for the engine's own transform gizmo (Interactive Tools Framework UCombinedTransformGizmo) on the Warehouse Planner's selected object: move arrows/plane + yaw ring, Space toggles Move/Rotate. Moves go through PreciseTransform's RepositionPlacedObject (grid snap, buildable area, occupancy). Replaces the hand-built cone gizmo (AWarehouseGizmoActor) and the abandoned PlacementGizmo/BP_WarehouseGizmo attempt.",
